<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Choose - Shiroca</title>

<style>
body{
margin:0;
font-family:Arial,sans-serif;
background:#0b0b14;
color:white;
min-height:100vh;
display:flex;
justify-content:center;
align-items:center;
text-align:center;
}

.container{
max-width:900px;
padding:30px;
}

h1{
font-size:42px;
margin-bottom:10px;
}

p{
color:#cfcfcf;
font-size:18px;
margin-bottom:35px;
}

.grid{
display:grid;
grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);
gap:20px;
}

.card{
background:#161625;
padding:30px;
border-radius:20px;
cursor:pointer;
border:1px solid #2c2c44;
}

.card:hover{
border-color:#7c3aed;
}

.card h2{
margin-bottom:10px;
}

.card a{
color:white;
text-decoration:none;
display:block;
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="container">
<h1>Choose Your Companion</h1>
<p>Select the type of connection you want to build.</p>

<div class="grid">

<div class="card">
<a href="chat.html?type=girlfriend">
<h2>AI Girlfriend</h2>
<p>Romantic, caring and emotionally connected.</p>
</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<a href="chat.html?type=boyfriend">
<h2>AI Boyfriend</h2>
<p>Protective, loyal and deeply supportive.</p>
</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<a href="chat.html?type=friend">
<h2>AI Friend</h2>
<p>Funny, honest and always there for you.</p>
</a>
</div>

<div class="card">
<a href="chat.html?type=mentor">
<h2>AI Mentor</h2>
<p>Smart, focused and built to help you grow.</p>
</a>
</div>

</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>
